{"id": "bench-02", "instruction": "在原点建一个 20x20x20 的纯红色立方体。", "tags": ["single", "box", "color"], "difficulty": 1, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "props": {"size": [20, 20, 20], "color": [255, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.6}]}
{"id": "bench-03", "instruction": "建一个半径 8 的纯黄色球体，再把它的颜色改成纯蓝色。", "tags": ["single", "edit", "color"], "difficulty": 1, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [16, 16, 16], "color": [0, 0, 255]}, "tol": 0.6}]}
{"id": "bench-04", "instruction": "建一个 10x10x50 的细高塔，发现太高了，把它的高度（Z 轴尺寸）缩小到原来的一半，X/Y 尺寸保持不变。", "tags": ["single", "edit", "scale"], "difficulty": 2, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "props": {"size": [10, 10, 25]}, "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-05", "instruction": "在原点建一个 20x20x2 的深灰色基座，然后在基座正上方放置一个半径为 8 的纯红色球体，球底紧贴基座顶面，X/Y 居中。", "tags": ["compose", "stack", "spatial"], "difficulty": 2, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [16, 16, 16], "color": [255, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.6}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "props": {"size": [20, 20, 2]}, "tol": 0.6}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"type": "Surface"}, "b": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-06", "instruction": "先在原点建一个 50x50x10 的纯黑色方形基座，再在基座正上方放置一个半径为 15 的纯白色球体，球底紧贴基座顶面并 X/Y 居中。", "tags": ["compose", "stack", "spatial"], "difficulty": 2, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [30, 30, 30], "color": [255, 255, 255]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "props": {"size": [50, 50, 10], "color": [0, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"type": "Surface"}, "b": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-07", "instruction": "在原点建一个半径 5、高 30 的纯红色圆柱形桥墩；在它沿 X 轴正方向距离 50 个单位处，建另一个半径 5、高 30 的纯蓝色圆柱形桥墩。", "tags": ["compose", "distance", "cylinder"], "difficulty": 2, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [0, 0, 255]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [0, 0, 255]}, "b": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "relation": "distance", "value": 50, "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-08", "instruction": "在原点建一个 30x30x30 的方块，然后在它的顶部正中心放一个半径 10 的纯红色球体，球底紧贴方块顶面。", "tags": ["compose", "stack", "spatial"], "difficulty": 2, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [20, 20, 20], "color": [255, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"type": "Surface"}, "b": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-09", "instruction": "建一个半径 30、高 5 的灰色圆柱平台，在平台正中心垂直立一根半径 2、高 40 的旗杆（细圆柱），旗杆底面紧贴平台顶面。", "tags": ["compose", "align", "cylinder"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [4, 4, 40]}, "b": {"size": [60, 60, 5]}, "relation": "center_aligned", "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [4, 4, 40]}, "b": {"size": [60, 60, 5]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-10", "instruction": "沿 X 轴等距建 3 个 10x10x10 的方块，相邻方块中心间距 15，第一个在原点；颜色从原点起依次为红、绿、蓝。", "tags": ["array", "color", "spacing"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [0, 255, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [0, 0, 255]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [0, 255, 0]}, "b": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "relation": "distance", "value": 15, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [0, 0, 255]}, "b": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "relation": "distance", "value": 30, "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-11", "instruction": "建 5 个 10x2x2 的纯黄色方块，沿 Y 轴等距阵列，相邻中心间距 5，然后打成一个群组，命名为「减速带」。", "tags": ["array", "group", "color"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [255, 255, 0]}, "n": 5}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"in_group": "减速带"}, "n": 5}]}
{"id": "bench-12", "instruction": "沿 X 轴等距建 4 个半径 5 的球体，相邻中心间距 25，全部放到名为「阵列层」的图层上。", "tags": ["array", "layer", "count"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 4}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"layer": "阵列层"}, "n": 4}]}
{"id": "bench-13", "instruction": "沿 X 轴等距建 6 根半径 1、高 30 的柱子，相邻中心间距 15，打成群组「栅栏」。", "tags": ["array", "group", "cylinder"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"in_group": "栅栏"}, "n": 6}]}
{"id": "bench-14", "instruction": "建一个金字塔基座：底层 50x50x10，中层 35x35x10 居中叠在底层正上方，顶层 20x20x10 居中叠在中层正上方。", "tags": ["compose", "stack", "align"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 3}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [50, 50, 10]}, "props": {"size": [50, 50, 10]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [35, 35, 10]}, "props": {"size": [35, 35, 10]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [20, 20, 10]}, "props": {"size": [20, 20, 10]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [35, 35, 10]}, "b": {"size": [50, 50, 10]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.0}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [20, 20, 10]}, "b": {"size": [35, 35, 10]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-15", "instruction": "建一个红绿灯：一根半径 3、高 60 的纯黑色立杆；在杆顶从上到下依次叠放红、黄、绿三个半径 5 的球，三球垂直对齐且彼此紧贴。", "tags": ["compose", "stack", "color"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 3}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [255, 255, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"color": [0, 255, 0]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "b": {"color": [255, 255, 0]}, "relation": "above", "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [255, 255, 0]}, "b": {"color": [0, 255, 0]}, "relation": "above", "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "b": {"color": [0, 255, 0]}, "relation": "center_aligned", "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-16", "instruction": "建一个靶盘：半径 30 的纯白色圆盘、半径 20 的纯红色圆盘、半径 10 的纯黑色圆盘，三者厚度均为 2，沿 Z 轴从下到上由大到小同心叠放（X/Y 中心对齐）。", "tags": ["compose", "concentric", "color"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 3}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [60, 60, 2]}, "props": {"color": [255, 255, 255]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [40, 40, 2]}, "props": {"color": [255, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [20, 20, 2]}, "props": {"color": [0, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [40, 40, 2]}, "b": {"size": [60, 60, 2]}, "relation": "center_aligned", "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [20, 20, 2]}, "b": {"size": [40, 40, 2]}, "relation": "center_aligned", "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-17", "instruction": "建一个书架：一块 80x20x2 的竖板，配 4 块 80x20x2 的横板沿 Z 轴等距分层（相邻中心间距 25），全部打成群组「书架」。", "tags": ["compose", "array", "group"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 5}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"in_group": "书架"}, "n": 5}]}
